stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> NoLease
  NoLease --> Acquiring: authoring requested
  Acquiring --> Leased: seat available
  Acquiring --> Denied: no seat
  Leased --> Renewing
  Renewing --> Leased: success
  Renewing --> Grace: temporary failure
  Grace --> Leased: recovered
  Grace --> Lost: grace/lease ends
  Leased --> Releasing: Max exit / no longer needed
  Releasing --> NoLease
